  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = 2.5\n\ny = 5/8\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(x - y) × 4\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x - y = 2.5 - 5/8\n\n⇒ x - y = 20/8 - 5/8\n\n⇒ x - y = 15/8\n\n⇒ (x - y) × 4 = (15/8) × 4\n\n⇒ (x - y) × 4 = 60/8\n\n⇒ (x - y) × 4 = 7.5\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 7.5.**",
